1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,825
W1: Sarah, I overheard Mr. Denver saying that Mr. Rodriguez is coming for a visit next Monday.

2
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,085
W2: Oh, no.

3
00:00:07,885 --> 00:00:10,225
I hope he's not bringing us bad news again.

4
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:15,665
I mean, he seldom makes a trip out here, but when he does, he usually brings us bad news.

5
00:00:16,105 --> 00:00:23,455
The last time he came he told us about the budget cut, and that really affected a lot of our salespeople here.

6
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:27,125
W1: I know, but let's just hope that it'll be something good this time.

7
00:00:27,675 --> 00:00:28,285
Who knows?

8
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:32,015
He could be coming here to tell us that we will be getting a bonus or something.

9
00:00:32,445 --> 00:00:34,370
W2: I doubt that very much.
